WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.349
Roxy flew over the city.

2
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:09.976
Everywhere she looked, there were mushroom monsters.

3
00:00:09.977 --> 00:00:13.582
She spotted three of them turning over garbage cans.

4
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:16.964
"I have an idea!"

5
00:00:16.965 --> 00:00:20.050
Roxy used her freeze breath on the mushroom monsters.

6
00:00:20.051 --> 00:00:22.309
Instantly they froze.

7
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:25.410
"That will hold them for a while!" she thought.

8
00:00:25.411 --> 00:00:27.509
Just then a woman screamed.

9
00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:30.474
She was carrying trash to an open dumpster.

10
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:34.754
But two mushroom monsters were inside, scooping garbage into their mouths.

11
00:00:34.755 --> 00:00:36.670
One of them spotted the woman.

12
00:00:36.671 --> 00:00:39.628
It reached out of the dumpster to grab her trash.

13
00:00:39.629 --> 00:00:42.729
"Rocket Girl, help!" the woman yelled.

14
00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.898
"This thing is attacking me!"

15
00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:49.191
Roxy swooped down. Thwap!

16
00:00:49.192 --> 00:00:53.108
She slammed the lid of the dumpster closed, trapping the monsters.

17
00:00:53.109 --> 00:00:55.659
Then she sat on top of the dumpster.

18
00:00:55.660 --> 00:01:01.315
Bang! Bang! Bang! The monsters banged on the dumpster, trying to get out.

19
00:01:01.316 --> 00:01:03.692
"No way!" Roxy said.

20
00:01:03.693 --> 00:01:07.638
"You're staying in here till I figure out what to do next!"

21
00:01:07.639 --> 00:01:09.995
Finally the monsters stopped banging.

22
00:01:09.996 --> 00:01:12.209
Roxy peeked into the dumpster.

23
00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.683
The creatures were asleep.

24
00:01:14.684 --> 00:01:18.599
But as a sunbeam crossed its face, one opened its eyes.

25
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:20.927
Roxy quietly closed the lid.

26
00:01:20.928 --> 00:01:23.405
"Hmm," she thought.

27
00:01:23.406 --> 00:01:28.648
"That's interesting. The darkness makes the mushroom monsters sleepy.

28
00:01:28.649 --> 00:01:33.949
I'll collect the rest of them and put them in here!" Roxy

29
00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:39.983
flew around and gathered up some mushroom monsters. But

30
00:01:39.984 --> 00:01:43.400
when she returned to the dumpster, she blinked in surprise. The

31
00:01:43.401 --> 00:01:45.520
monsters had disappeared. Instead

32
00:01:45.521 --> 00:01:49.503
Roxy saw puddles of slime! "Whoa!"

33
00:01:49.504 --> 00:01:51.479
Roxy said. "Without

34
00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:55.858
sunlight, the mushroom monsters turn into slime! Maybe

35
00:01:55.859 --> 00:02:02.129
the slime came from the cave." Roxy

36
00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:06.225
put the monsters in the dumpster. "Don't

37
00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:08.293
worry," she said. "I'll

38
00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:10.992
be back soon with the rest of your friends. Then

39
00:02:10.993 --> 00:02:14.203
I'll take all of you home to your cave." "Gorp!

40
00:02:14.204 --> 00:02:17.539
Gorp!" ***

41
00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.286
The two garbage collectors drove back to the dump.

42
00:02:20.287 --> 00:02:23.114
Their truck was filled with more garbage.

43
00:02:23.115 --> 00:02:26.121
"This is our last load for the day," Grover said.

44
00:02:26.122 --> 00:02:27.603
"Let's dump it!"

45
00:02:27.604 --> 00:02:31.091
Ernie pressed a button.

46
00:02:31.092 --> 00:02:34.599
Whir! The back of the truck tilted.

47
00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.948
Grover looked in a mirror to watch the garbage spill.

48
00:02:37.949 --> 00:02:40.647
"Hey! What are those things?"

49
00:02:40.648 --> 00:02:42.467
"Huh?" Ernie said.

50
00:02:42.468 --> 00:02:47.506
Suddenly hungry mushroom monsters surrounded the truck. "Gorp! Gorp!"

51
00:02:47.507 --> 00:02:51.796
"Ahh!" Ernie cried. "Let's get out of here!"

52
00:02:51.797 --> 00:02:54.747
He shifted gears and stomped on the gas pedal.

53
00:02:54.748 --> 00:02:56.509
The truck shot forward.

54
00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.645
Garbage poured out of the back.

55
00:02:58.646 --> 00:03:04.907
Mushroom monsters followed the truck as it headed back to Metro City!

